|  MG Level| Presmooth|PostSmooth|CorrectSmo|
+-------------------------------------------+
|         0|         1|         0|         0|
|         1|         2|         0|         0|
|         2|         3|         0|         0|
+-------------------------------------------+
Courant-Friedrichs-Lewy number:       10

